      "content": "thanks for that. it's a lot better than the draft, definitely more readable. \n\nthe thing is, looking at the backend log for that version, the thoroughness score came back a bit lower than we usually aim for in the \"Modern Chef\" series. it's not a dealbreaker, but for the premium edition, we really want these recipes to feel very detailed and comprehensive.\n\ncould you try another pass? maybe expand the instructions just a little bit so there's more detail in the steps? just please keep it natural—i don't want it to feel like you're just listing ingredients over and over, i just want the steps to feel more robust and \"thorough\" for the reader.",
